## COMMUNICATION
Multimetallic MOFs with modulated compositions have been successfully created and directly adopted as efficient OER catalysts. The Fe/Ni/Co/(Mn)-MIL-53 exhibits a volcano-type oxygen evolution reaction (OER) activity as a function of compositions. The optimized Fe/Ni/Mn0.4-MIL-53/NF is highly active and ultrastable towards OER catalysis.
